# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model and run artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# These are large and machine-specific. `stats/` is deliberately NOT ignored --
# the two shipped stats files are test fixtures and the golden tests read them.
*.safetensors
# ...except the channel-moment sidecars, which are measurements rather than
# weights -- the same reason `stats/` is kept. ~6.6 MB per fine-tune arm, they are
# the cardinal sensitivity estimator's only input, and the box that produces them
# is not a volume, so this repo is where they survive.
!**/stats/dynquant_moments.safetensors
*.bin
*.gguf
*.pt
*.ckpt
checkpoints/
outputs/
runs/
wandb/
logs/
out/
!tests/**/*.safetensors

# Autotuner cache, if a run is pointed at the repo instead of the user cache dir
.dynquant_cache/
autotune.json

